 ignoring threats to  the well-being of future generations in  Alaska warmer temperatures are  melting the permafrost villages are  literally disappearing and scientists  say Alaska today is fair warning of the  climate change future for the rest of  America for CBS this morning saturday  Barry Peterson key avec Alaska
 

